  "FriendlyName": "Unreal AI EnhancedInput",
  "Description": "RQL module for Unreal's Enhanced Input system: author full control schemes (on foot, vehicle, menu): input actions, mapping contexts with priorities, keyboard / mouse / gamepad mappings, triggers (hold, tap, pulse, chords, combos, toggles) and modifiers (dead zones, negate, swizzle, scale), player-rebindable keys with Enhanced Input user settings, and the Blueprint wiring that swaps contexts on possession and binds actions to functions; query everything back. An AI Game Developer (Unreal-MCP) extension: an IUnrealMcpRqlModule that agents use through rql-query / rql-mutate / rql-schema.",
  "Category": "AI",
  "CreatedBy": "IvanMurzak/Unreal-AI-EnhancedInput",
